Package: editR
Title: Edit Deconvolution by Inference of Traces in R
Version: 1.0.10
Description: Predicts base editing from Sanger sequencing data by
    quantifying fluorescence traces. Fits zero-adjusted gamma distributions
    to background noise and assigns p-values for each base call in a guide
    RNA region.
Author: Mitchell Kluesner, Branden Moriarity
Maintainer: Mitchell Kluesner <mkluesne@fredhutch.org>
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
